    {
      "uid": "zhcn:578a105659d2c1d262b65b93",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（距离『Parcae』推导的，最适合出道战的日子还差一点。\n身体状况也按预想中的那样调整了……然而）",
      "source_fingerprint": "5814df2eab5f14e996d5a02ca0e19bef0f78b3783c87f45c43aa01b8122b0acc",
