      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不仅如此……她那直勾勾的锐利视线，\r\n仿佛是穿透了马娘们和电脑，在寻找着什么――",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f2ce7c1fa4e92014b826d09334970fc2f1ca3dd6c668bd73e13e26b7fba0908",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
